{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/独行者的本能","pageid":8383,"revid":20771,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%8B%AC%E8%A1%8C%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%AC%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%8B%AC%E8%A1%8C%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%AC%E8%83%BD&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%8B%AC%E8%A1%8C%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%AC%E8%83%BD&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>独行者的本能</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E7.8B.AC.E8.A1.8C.E8.80.85.E7.9A.84.E6.9C.AC.E8.83.BD\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"独行者的本能\"><b>独行者的本能</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"技能 独行者的本能.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/eb/h7zrqulgfotax8gm3csj54qn5f51o4l.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%8B%AC%E8%A1%8C%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%AC%E8%83%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/eb/h7zrqulgfotax8gm3csj54qn5f51o4l.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%8B%AC%E8%A1%8C%E8%80%85%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%AC%E8%83%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/eb/h7zrqulgfotax8gm3csj54qn5f51o4l.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />独行者的本能\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[反应]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（反应）自身和[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰碴\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">冰碴</font></span></span>]受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>，范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内没有友军时，受到伤害额外降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰碴\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">冰碴</font></span></span>]拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"不屈\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">不屈</font></span></span>]，触发时回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">100%</font>生命值，并获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"隐身\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">隐身</font></span></span>]（持续1回合）、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"免伤3\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">免伤3</font></span></span>]（持续2回合）。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_hea